  "description": "A parametric LOGO SIGNAGE on the six-node spine — Geometry → Input Properties → Math Engine → Output Metrics → 2D Render + 3D Render.\n\nDROP IT ON A WALL SEGMENT. Position slides it along the wall, Centre height sets it in elevation, Flip side picks the face. The letters are BLOCKS sized by count, height and aspect — the canvas cannot set type. The `text` param carries the real wording; the Blender stage replaces the blocks with extruded text of the same height, depth and colour.\n\nDEFAULTS are the INFRA Reception review: MARIAN, dark blue not black, backlit (slide 26).",
